rited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Lemma 10.3 and Theorem 10.1, pp. 236–239; scans 244–247"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"6"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" href=\"?note=e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton\">73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton</a>。补集的全集固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}complementation}\\vdash\n\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}complementation}\\vdash\n\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先消除会使输入无法读完的 ε 循环及阻塞行为，转换为会扫描完整输入的规范 DPDA，再调整终态。直接交换任意 DPDA 的终态一般不正确：停在余下未读输入的配置不会因此接受整个词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"e63e7d14efa1e2c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"e63e7d14efa1e2c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}$，见 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]。补集的全集固定为 $\\Sigma^*$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}complementation}\\vdash\n\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}","display":true}],"bytes":1458,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-dcfl-complementation|DCFL 对补集封闭]]"}],"outgoing":["e63e7d14efa1e2c3"]}